                    "message": "a module's tests import no workspace but @app-template/testing, the module contracts, @app-template/kernel/testing, the inventory (@app-template/kernel/aws/resources) and the data layer's stores (@app-template/kernel/data/*) they arrange through, and no @effect/* package except the test runner @effect/vitest and @effect/platform-bun for BunCrypto.layer"
                  },
                  {
                    "group": [
                      "#testing-e2e/**",
                      "@app-template/*/testing-e2e",
                      "@app-template/*/testing-e2e/**"
                    ],
                    "message": "a unit test and its support import no e2e support (#testing-e2e/\u2026, @app-template/*/testing-e2e): unit tests run with no container"
                  },
                  {
                    "group": ["./**", "../**"],
                    "message": "inside a workspace import through its #<workspace>/\u2026 subpath, never a relative path"
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
